    "realized_geometry_sha256": "The wire is published (RFC 0079), but the binary64 vertex coordinates are not determined by any published contract. RFC 0082 pins only the mathematical phase theta_i = 2 pi i / n; it pins neither a binary64 association order nor a correctly-rounded transcendental, and RFC 0082 and the capability matrix both explicitly non-claim cross-platform mesh-byte identity. Every regular inscribed polygon with n >= 8 has irrational vertices, so no admissible witness avoids this.",
