    "correspondence_sha256": "eqiora.geometry-mesh-correspondence-envelope/v1 has no published wire in any RFC, schema, or document. RFC 0049 additionally closes it over one exact Model artifact, whose Domain ULIDs are author-chosen and are not determined by the frozen public claim."
